{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snapshots</strong> is a short game about organizing messy spaces. Place every object back where it belongs, discovering and deciphering secrets hidden amongst the clutter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953120/extras/01808658249c0854e82f8d6ba4d3f069.poster.avif?t=1765188400\" width=1170 height=628 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953120/extras/01808658249c0854e82f8d6ba4d3f069.webm?t=1765188400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953120/extras/01808658249c0854e82f8d6ba4d3f069.mp4?t=1765188400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Populate cabinets, rearrange draws; experience the\u00a0small joy of putting things right where they belong.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953120/extras/59ae95310cb7443c47868784d29f5782.poster.avif?t=1765188400\" width=1170 height=628 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953120/extras/59ae95310cb7443c47868784d29f5782.webm?t=1765188400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953120/extras/59ae95310cb7443c47868784d29f5782.mp4?t=1765188400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0 \u00a0 15 hand-crafted levels to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0 \u00a0 An original soundtrack to accompany you in your organizational flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0 \u00a0 Atmospheric sound design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0 \u00a0 Easy to pickup, drag and drop controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0 \u00a0 Secrets to discover and decipher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953120/extras/02b5f8c2d9abdc906ea08ceb42ba1ac4.poster.avif?t=1765188400\" width=998 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953120/extras/02b5f8c2d9abdc906ea08ceb42ba1ac4.webm?t=1765188400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953120/extras/02b5f8c2d9abdc906ea08ceb42ba1ac4.mp4?t=1765188400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953120?t=1765188400","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953120/f6636f3885bdea9b2abcb25a3fd10389dfd4b87c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765188400","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953120/03ff3b7f3f146f5b1d39425b3459c320f2ba8584/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765188400","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953120/03ff3b7f3f146f5b1d39425b3459c320f2ba8584/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765188400","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snapshots</strong> is a short game about organizing messy spaces. Place every object back where 